---
kind: scene
id: east.ashTowerLens
title: Ash Tower, through the lens
on: enterPlace
target: place.ashTowerHall
priority: 30
when: "holds('hasItem', ['spectralLens']) && run.lair.towerSiege != 'cleared'"
---

// With the spectralLens (mid, mid.gameCorner) the thing on the stairs can be
// seen. The engine opens ashTowerStairs (canPass holds); this scene is the
// moment the player walks up to it. A scripted wild battle with the spirit;
// the engine raises caught / battleEnd afterwards.

## The third step

::bg{location="ash-tower-hall" time="night"}
::music{playback="change" mood="eerie" volume="down"}
::set{run.lair.towerSiege = "found" when="run.lair.towerSiege == 'hidden'"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: You raise the Spectral Lens. The thing on the third step has a shape now: a phantomaw, grey as candle smoke, standing between the stairs and the living.
@narrator{code="0020"}: It is not angry. It is guarding something. It does not know how to stop.
::encounter{species="phantomaw" level="28"}
@narrator{code="0030"}: When it is over, the phantomaw looks at you through the lens for a long moment. Then it is only smoke, and the stairs are only stairs.
@narrator{code="0040"}: From far above, very faint, someone is shouting at someone else to be quiet.
